+; Native IT linear E/F/G. The host resolves IT memory and appends two exact
+; OpenMPT/IT table deltas to every linear slide command:
+;   ARP1 = up delta from 1.0 (or from 2.0 for regular parameters >= C0h)
+;   ARP2 = 1.0 - down factor
